-#                       + (Absolute(4 - 4) * 1.0)
-#                       + (Absolute(4 - 6) * 0.6)
-#                       + (Absolute(4 - 7) * 0.3)
-#                       = 2.5
-
-#     Impurity = Total error / total weight
-#              = 2.5 / 2.3
-#              = 1.08695652173913
-#              ------------------
-
-#     From this root node, the next best split is between X values of 3 and 5.
-#     Thus, we have left and right child nodes:
